{"ref":"BDB, אֲרַמִּי","hw":"אֲרַמִּי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַמִּי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent. Aramæan</strong>, c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:20\" href=\"/Genesis.25.20\">Gn 25:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:5\" href=\"/Genesis.28.5\">28:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:20\" href=\"/Genesis.31.20\">31:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:24\" href=\"/Genesis.31.24\">24</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.20\">2 K 5:20</a>; of Israel <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אֹבֵד</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.5\">Dt 26:5</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:28\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.28\">2 K 8:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.29\">29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָם</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.15\">9:15</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרַמִּים</span> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">הָא׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.5\">2 Ch 22:5</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּילַגְשׁוֹ הָאֲרַמִּיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.14\">1 Ch 7:14</a> <em>his Aramæan concubine</em>.—(<span dir=\"rtl\">ארומים</span> Kt <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.6\">2 K 16:6</a> read rather Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדוֹמִים</span>.)","next":"BDB, אֲרָמִית","prev":"BDB, אֲרָם"}